        "text_preview": "In view of the aforesaid submissions, the present application is disposed of with the direction that in case, the applicant surrenders before the Court concerned and applies for bail within three weeks from today, his bail application shall"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "a518cba658fb40128fa83baa921dd1f0_18",
